        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Akili Smith, Tim Couch, Donovan McNabb\n- Organizations: Cincinnati Bengals, Cleveland Browns, Philadelphia Eagles, University of Kentucky, Kentucky Wildcats, Penn State Nittany Lions\n- Events: 1999 NFL Draft, 1999 Outback Bowl\n- Roles: Quarterbacks\n\nFacts:\n- Tim Couch played college football for the University of Kentucky and earned All-America honors.\n- The 1999 Outback Bowl featured the Kentucky Wildcats and the Penn State Nittany Lions.\n- Tim Couch, quarterback of the 1998 Kentucky Wildcats football team, was the first overall pick in the 1999 NFL Draft.\n- In the 1999 NFL Draft, Tim Couch was selected first overall by the Cleveland Browns, Donovan McNabb was selected after him by the Philadelphia Eagles, and Akili Smith was drafted third overall in the first round by the Cincinnati Bengals as the third quarterback in the first three picks.",
